Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没事  我们会把卡拉佩特安拿到手的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. We're gonna land Karapetyan.
