Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们迟早会抓到他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it's only a matter of time before we get 'em.
