Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.11,0:18:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,却都不能确定她是不是还活着吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you don't even know if she's alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.20,0:18:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这叫假设{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called a hypothesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.26,0:18:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚我们第一次启动了隧道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last night, we powered up the tunnel for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.98,0:18:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但过载  于是关停了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was overloaded and it shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.10,0:18:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但就在那一瞬间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But for a split second,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.95,0:18:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,通往量子域的大门被打开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the doorway to the quantum realm was opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.17,0:18:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,五分钟后  你打了来  说起了我妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And five minutes later, you called, talking about Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们认为你去那下面时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We think when you were down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.86,0:18:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可能跟她发生了纠缠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you may have entangled with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.66,0:18:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,汉克  我绝不会那么做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hank, I would never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.55,0:18:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我是尊重你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I respect you too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.31,0:18:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,量子纠缠  斯科特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quantum entanglement, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们认为她可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We think she might have
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.19,0:18:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,在你脑袋里放了信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}put some kind of a message in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.23,0:18:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,希望是个位置信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully, a location.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.27,0:18:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,打开隧道时  信息被触发了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And opening the tunnel triggered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈在我脑袋里留了信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mom put a message in my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.54,0:18:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  这疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.34,0:18:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不  斯科特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.49,0:18:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,疯狂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Insane
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是不告诉我们就跑去德国跟复仇者联盟打架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is going to Germany without telling us, and fighting the Avengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.57,0:18:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我  关于你偷的战衣  你没撒谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just tell me you weren't lying about the suit you took.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.91,0:18:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我你确实销毁了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me you really destroyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  我销毁了它  我发誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did, I destroyed it, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:19:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信你销毁了我的战衣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe you destroyed my suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是我的毕生心血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was my life's work!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.03,0:19:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你就不该偷走我的战衣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were supposed to not take my suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起  汉克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Hank!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.11,0:19:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起我偷走了战衣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I took the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.47,0:19:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起我昨晚打了电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry that I called last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.68,0:19:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我不记得在下面见过珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember seeing Janet down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.09,0:19:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我也希望我见过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish that I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是梦到了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just had a dream about her
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,跟一个小姑娘玩捉迷藏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}playing hide-and-seek with a little girl.
