Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.51,0:19:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了个梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.58,0:19:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她在跟个小姑娘玩捉迷藏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was playing hide-and-seek with a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.47,0:19:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,凯西和我以前常玩的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cassie and I do it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.57,0:19:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但梦里的是凯西吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But was it Cassie in the dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.43,0:19:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,她藏在了哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where was she hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.61,0:19:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么  - 那个小姑娘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? -  The little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.91,0:19:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,她藏在了哪里  大衣柜吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where was she hiding? Was it in a wardrobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.68,0:19:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不是  是个很大的柜子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it was in a tall dresser.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.31,0:19:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,就是大衣柜咯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean a wardrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.61,0:19:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是这么叫的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what that's called?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.23,0:19:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,什么颜色的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What color was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.47,0:19:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,红的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.59,0:19:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,上面有小马吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were there horses on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.76,0:19:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.93,0:19:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们玩时  我每次都藏在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's where I hid every time that we played.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.39,0:20:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,听上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't sound like
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你没太理解这游戏的要义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you really got the gist of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,她还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.16,0:20:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.13,0:20:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得拿到那个部件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.57,0:20:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.56,0:20:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们越早让隧道正常运作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sooner we get the tunnel working...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,就能越早从他脑袋里提取到信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sooner we can get this message out of his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.71,0:20:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,伯奇拿到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does Burch have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的  我们走  - 什么部件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. Let's go. -  What part?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.31,0:20:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,伯奇是谁  等等  什么情况啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's Burch? Wait. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.06,0:20:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一个部件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a component
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.78,0:20:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,来防止隧道再次过载{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to stop the tunnel from overloading again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.40,0:20:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你拿了衣服  你最好换一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I grabbed your clothes. You might want to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  我也想帮你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'd really like to help you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.33,0:20:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果他们来给我摘脚环时我不在家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but if I'm not at home when they come to take off my ankle monitor
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.88,0:20:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就要蹲一辈子了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then I'm going away forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们拿到了部件  启动了隧道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we get the component and power up the tunnel
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就能拿到信息  你午饭前就能回到家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll get the message, and have you home by lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得快点  纠缠不会维持太久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to hurry. The entanglement won't last.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:20:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你欠我们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You owe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.45,0:21:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我能不能进去等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, fine. But can I just wait inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我不该在外面的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm not supposed to be out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.44,0:21:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.97,0:21:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没问题吧  - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We good? -  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我就回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.73,0:21:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我能吃个吗  - 不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I have one of these? -  No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.15,0:22:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,苏珊  欢迎来到好餐厅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Susan! Welcome to Oui!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,桑尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonny!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.16,0:22:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"好"是法语"是"的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oui is French for "Yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.66,0:22:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,立意就是  是从农场直接上餐桌的本地好料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As in "Yes" to farm-to-table, "Yes" to locally sourced...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.72,0:22:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是把生态摆在利益之前的好策略{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and "Yes" to planet before profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那希望“你是否拿到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's hope it also means "Yes"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.01,0:22:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我订购的部件”的答案也是“是”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to "Do you have the component I ordered?"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.18,0:22:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我一向喜欢你的幽默感  苏珊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I have always loved your sense of humor, Susan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.05,0:22:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,请坐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.55,0:22:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了  谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm good. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.71,0:22:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这人是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.99,0:22:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,桑尼·伯奇  黑市科技走私贩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonny Burch. He traffics in black market technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.78,0:22:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他为我们取得了建造隧道需要的材料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been getting us what we need to build the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.31,0:22:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,能给我一个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could I just have one...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.86,0:22:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.82,0:22:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我在联调局有个特别的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I have a special friend at the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.31,0:22:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我说"特别"是因为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I say "Special" because,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.49,0:22:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他会告诉我些我原本不知道的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well, he tells me things that I didn't previously know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.37,0:22:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,比如说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For example...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.12,0:22:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你名字不叫苏珊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your name isn't Susan.
