Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.25,0:29:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,燕麦片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oatmeal packets.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.72,0:29:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是侮辱  - 怎么是侮辱了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's insult. -  Why is it an insult?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.43,0:29:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那味道像沙子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it tastes like sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.52,0:29:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,知道为什么吗  因为那是有机食品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why? 'Cause it's organic.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.16,0:29:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不是有机食品  是沙子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not organic, it's sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.52,0:29:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是一天最重要的一餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the most important meal of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.64,0:29:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以随意发挥嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, you can get creative with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.80,0:29:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,能硌断牙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.53,0:29:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,撒点红糖  撒点肉桂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put a little brown sugar on it. You can put some cinnamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.58,0:29:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,倒点蜂蜜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put a little honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.10,0:29:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 随心所欲  - 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whatever you want... -  Guys, guys, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.24,0:29:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,干什么啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.49,0:29:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有更要紧的事呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got bigger fish to fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.58,0:29:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的桌子吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that my desk?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.83,0:29:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的  - 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. -  What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.98,0:29:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我的桌子那么小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do I have such a small desk?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.37,0:29:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们选桌子时你又不在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you weren't there when we were choosing desks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.92,0:29:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,打瞌睡  没得选{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You snooze, you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.14,0:29:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我在被软禁啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I was under house arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.31,0:29:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.86,0:29:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗  这都算不上是桌子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, this isn't even a desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.25,0:29:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这是垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.26,0:29:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是在外面的垃圾里找来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You found this outside amongst garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.93,0:30:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是在旧物义卖上淘来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it at a rummage sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.21,0:30:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你就偏在我的桌子上省钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you save money on my desk?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.92,0:30:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.65,0:30:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,霍普  拜托  我们得集中精神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope, please, we need to focus, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.24,0:30:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧找到那个实验室  天呐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta find that lab already. Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.50,0:30:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗  我听说了你的遭遇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you know what? I heard stories, like what happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.13,0:30:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,说有个吓人的家伙  能钻墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This crazy, creepy cat, who walks through walls and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.56,0:30:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,像个幽灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.35,0:30:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,像雅加婆婆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Baba Yaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.01,0:30:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,雅加婆婆  女巫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baba Yaga, the witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.52,0:30:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们给小孩子讲故事吓唬他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They tell stories to children to frighten them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.68,0:30:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道雅加婆婆吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know Baba Yaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.00,0:30:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是谁偷的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever stole it...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.75,0:30:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得找到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we need to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.09,0:30:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的人是找不到的  得等他们找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you don't find someone like that. They find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.93,0:30:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就像雅加婆婆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Baba Yaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.84,0:30:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,皮姆博士  你是我认识的最聪明的天才{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Pym, you're the smartest genius I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.49,0:30:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有在实验室上安装寻回系统吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't you put some kind of LoJack on your lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.90,0:30:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,因为如果你没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if you didn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这里有很多价钱公道的选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have a variety of affordable options.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.11,0:30:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然安装了  路易斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I did, Luis.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.41,0:30:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,系统被解除了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.82,0:30:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,偷走实验室的人非常在行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever stole the lab knew exactly what they were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.59,0:30:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那人看上去好像还在变相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They also looked like they were phasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.69,0:30:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,变相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phasing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.66,0:30:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,量子变相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quantum phasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.57,0:30:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就是物体在物质的各状态间变化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When an object moves through different states of matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.90,0:31:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  我想的也是那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, that's what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.82,0:31:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,实验室释放辐射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lab emits radiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.05,0:31:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以改造一台量子光谱仪追踪它吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we modify a quantum spectrometer and track it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.77,0:31:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那是可行的  但我的设备都在实验室里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could work, yes, but all my equipment is in the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.95,0:31:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还有哪里有那样的设备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where else can we find that equipment?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.67,0:31:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是有那么个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there is one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.71,0:31:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔·福斯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill Foster.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.74,0:31:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.02,0:31:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's Bill Foster?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.10,0:31:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我爸爸的一个老同事  神盾局的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's an old colleague of my dad's, from S.H.I.E.L.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.96,0:31:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们多年前就闹崩了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had a falling out years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.35,0:31:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你似乎经常跟人闹崩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem to have a lot of falling outs with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.88,0:31:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,可能只是浪费时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's probably just a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.95,0:31:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我光是在这里可就是赌上了一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm risking everything by being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.84,0:31:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你不觉得我们该去问问吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think we should check?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.29,0:31:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得查明是谁偷走了实验室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to find out who took the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.24,0:32:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们  这样暴露在外可不太好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, it's not a good idea to be out in the open like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.25,0:32:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,放松  没人会认出我们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax, no one's gonna recognize us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.31,0:32:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么  就因为帽子和墨镜吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, because of hats and sunglasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.73,0:32:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这不叫伪装  汉克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not a disguise, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.20,0:32:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是像看棒球赛的自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We look like ourselves at a baseball game.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.73,0:32:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,在独立系统中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In an isolated system...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.77,0:32:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,粒子以稳定相关系共存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}particles co-exist in a stable phase relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.29,0:32:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,如果系统受到干扰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the system is interfered with,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.47,0:32:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,稳定就会变成混乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that stability becomes chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.07,0:32:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不可预测{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.09,0:32:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,危险  美妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dangerous. Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.95,0:32:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,完全独立的量子系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isolated completely, a quantum system
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.91,0:33:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,将退回到物质的不同状态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would revert back to separate states of matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.56,0:33:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,每一个都与其环境的独特状态纠缠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}each entangled with a distinct state of its environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.37,0:33:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.65,0:33:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这一物体将同时与多个平行现实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the object in question would be both in and out of phase
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.87,0:33:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,同相和异相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with multiple parallel realities.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.84,0:33:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,说到跟现实不同步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speaking of being out of phase with reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.62,0:33:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我注意到你们之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am noticing an unusually high number
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.32,0:33:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有异常多的朦胧目光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of glazed eyes out there among you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.40,0:33:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就提前几分钟结束吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, why don't we call it a few minutes early?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.14,0:33:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就到这儿吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll be enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.04,0:33:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  女士们先生们  你们可以走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, ladies and gentlemen, you may go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.28,0:33:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,真是难以置信  你与珍妮特相连{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's incredible. You're linked to Janet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.65,0:33:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你脑中波斯纳分子的各量子态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's quantum entanglement between the quantum states of
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.95,0:33:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,之间的量子纠缠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Posner molecules in your brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.13,0:33:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我也那么想的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.60,0:33:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是把"量子"一词加在每句话之前吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you guys just put the word "quantum" in front of everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.85,0:33:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,博士  我们得找到我们的实验室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor, we need to find our lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.58,0:33:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,霍普  我也想帮你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope, I'd love to help you...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.61,0:33:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但我并没有你说的那样的设备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't have anything like the equipment you're describing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.44,0:33:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说这是浪费时间  我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you this is a waste of time. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.96,0:33:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别瞧不起我  汉克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't condescend, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.41,0:33:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是你在躲避联调局的追捕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one who's on the run from the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.36,0:34:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为你非得把自己放大到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All because you had to grow to a size
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.32,0:34:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,与你的自大相配的尺寸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that finally fit your ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.36,0:34:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,德国那个不是我  是这个白痴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't me in Germany. It was this idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.25,0:34:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.26,0:34:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,变那么大肯定很累吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going that big, it must've been exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.16,0:34:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我之后整整睡了三天  你都无法想象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I slept for three days straight. You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.89,0:34:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我能想象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.02,0:34:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,想当年  我曾跟汉克搭档搞过一个项目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back in the day, I was Hank's partner on a project called
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.83,0:34:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,歌利亚(巨人){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goliath.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.66,0:34:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  你是我的搭档吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me? You were my partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.38,0:34:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一比变那么大还累的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing more tiring than going that big
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.78,0:34:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,就是忍受汉克的臭脾气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is putting up with Hank's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.61,0:34:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.65,0:34:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.43,0:34:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你变得多大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How big did you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.40,0:34:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,最高纪录是21英尺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My record? 21 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.86,0:34:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不赖啊  - 你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not bad. -  You?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.12,0:34:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,算了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.68,0:34:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不  真的  我很好奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, really, I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.77,0:34:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,65英尺  是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}65 feet. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.73,0:34:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好大啊  - 65英尺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Huge. -  65.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.98,0:34:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们俩比够大小了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you two are finished comparing sizes...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.86,0:34:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得想办法追踪实验室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we need to figure out a way to track down the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.52,0:34:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的汉克·皮姆还没想到办法吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the great Hank Pym hasn't figured that one out yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.60,0:34:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.19,0:34:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你想当年可是无所不知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had all the answers back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.04,0:34:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才离开了项目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I left the project.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.59,0:34:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,离开吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.96,0:34:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是我炒了你  - 我最正确的决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I fired you. -  Best decision I ever made.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.14,0:34:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,汉克是个糟糕的搭档  脾气暴躁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hank was a terrible partner. Temperamental...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.36,0:35:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,固执  没耐心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stubborn, impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.34,0:35:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他迟早会把所有人都推开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sooner or later, he just pushed everyone away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.66,0:35:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,只是那些庸才{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just the mediocrities.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.97,0:35:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮特是唯一受得了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Janet was the only one who could endure him
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.60,0:35:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,并选择留下来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and chose to stick it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.80,0:35:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点  比尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.64,0:35:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但她为此付出了代价  是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She paid the price, though, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.43,0:35:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.43,0:35:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是来这儿听你俩吵嘴的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't come here to listen to you two squabble.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.73,0:35:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我想救我妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to save my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.10,0:35:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你说是哪个办公室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, which office would you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.73,0:35:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是吴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's Woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.64,0:35:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是有人看见了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone must have seen me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.86,0:35:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,放松  如果是因为你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax. If this is about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.14,0:35:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们早该赶到你家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'd be in your house by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.50,0:35:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你是15岁小孩吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you, 15?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.32,0:35:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,快点  我们得马上走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We gotta go right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.62,0:35:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  你们或许能制造个临时追踪器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. You might be able to improvise that tracker...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.42,0:35:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,只需要修改你调节器的衍射组件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you modify the diffraction units on one of your regulators.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.44,0:35:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这可行  - 我都不知道那是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That could work. -  I don't know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.54,0:35:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.09,0:35:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, Doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.10,0:35:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,校警说他们发现了皮姆和凡·戴恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}campus police says they ID'd both Pym and Van Dyne.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.37,0:35:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么说  探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to tell you, Agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.63,0:35:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我都30年没跟汉克说过话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't talked to Hank in 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.86,0:36:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can assure you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.48,0:36:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我是他最不会想见的人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the last person he would want to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.16,0:36:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,得了  你指望我们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on, you expect us to...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.97,0:36:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.31,0:36:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,简单  我们恨死彼此了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simple. We hate each other's guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.80,0:36:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我是糟糕的搭档{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm a terrible partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.89,0:36:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,福斯特  在他平庸的职业生涯中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foster, he hasn't had one good idea
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.09,0:36:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,就没想出过一个好点子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in his unremarkable career.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.26,0:36:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但他关于衍射器的点子可行  是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But his idea about the diffractors could work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.31,0:36:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  一个好点子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine, one decent idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.55,0:36:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但我升级战衣时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except, I eliminated the diffractors
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.35,0:36:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,去掉了衍射器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I upgraded the suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.88,0:36:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  如果我们有旧战衣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if we had an old suit,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.07,0:36:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们或许就能追踪到实验室了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we might be able to track down the lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.43,0:36:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  但我们没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.99,0:36:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 如果我们有呢  - 你什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What if we did? -  What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.23,0:36:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.61,0:36:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,人生很奇妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}life's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.62,0:36:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐  你没销毁战衣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. You didn't destroy the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.33,0:36:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.95,0:36:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你毕生的心血  汉克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it was your life's work, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.91,0:36:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能销毁它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't destroy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.91,0:36:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我自首之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before I turned myself in,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.73,0:36:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我把它缩小然后邮给了路易斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shrunk it down and mailed it to Luis.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.91,0:36:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我的战衣邮寄了出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sent my suit through the mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.13,0:36:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,邮政服务是非常可靠的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, the postal service is very reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.61,0:36:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,现在有追踪码了  像快递服务一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, they do tracking numbers now. Like UPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.87,0:37:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,它在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.83,0:37:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,在一个非常安全的地方  别担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in a very safe place, all right? Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.77,0:37:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,奖杯吗  不在了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, the trophy? No, it's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.31,0:37:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫不在了  还能在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean it's not there? Where could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.91,0:37:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我到处看了  不在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I looked everywhere. It's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.65,0:37:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别动那盆花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, get away from the plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.10,0:37:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但我跟凯西玩过后  我放回...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I put it back after Cassie and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.99,0:37:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,展示说明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show-and-tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.76,0:37:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.72,0:37:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不  别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.29,0:37:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好消息是  我知道它在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the good news is I know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.15,0:37:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说回到学校时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whenever you go back to school
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.19,0:37:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,会觉得一切都变小了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}isn't everything supposed to look so much smaller?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.34,0:37:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方看上去好大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place seems huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.37,0:37:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.24,0:37:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是新调节器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the new regulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.36,0:37:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,汉克  这件战衣怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hank, what's going on with this suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.02,0:37:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是多"还没完成"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much of a work in progress is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.91,0:37:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.86,0:37:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你笑什么  拜托  你能不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you, laughing? Please, could you just...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.72,0:37:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.05,0:38:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.24,0:38:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,尺寸线圈故障了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sizing coils are malfunctioning.
