Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.88,0:44:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.72,0:44:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是你做了什么  皮姆博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what you've done, Dr. Pym.
