Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.25,0:45:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,为了恢复名誉  他不惜冒险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Desperate to restore his name, so he took risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.26,0:45:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.46,0:45:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,太冒险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.54,0:45:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,直到出了岔子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until something went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.56,0:45:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫我们跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told us to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.15,0:45:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,埃利海斯  怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elihas, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.03,0:45:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑吧  跑啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.99,0:45:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸  爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.75,0:45:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我看得出他很怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could tell he was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.19,0:45:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.92,0:45:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,艾娃  不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ava, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.41,0:45:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想留下他一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want him to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.32,0:45:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.52,0:46:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.49,0:46:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我醒来时  我父母都死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I woke up, my parents were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.65,0:46:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我就没那么幸运了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.51,0:46:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他们称之为"分子失调"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They call it "molecular disequilibrium."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.39,0:46:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这名字挺蠢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A rather dull name, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.42,0:46:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,并不能描述它的可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't quite do justice to what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.78,0:46:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我身体里的每一个细胞都被撕碎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every cell in my body is torn apart
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.70,0:46:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,然后又被组了回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and stitched back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.21,0:46:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一遍又一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.98,0:46:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,日复一日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.18,0:46:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时还在神盾局  接到电话说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was still at S.H.I.E.L.D. when I got the call about a
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.82,0:46:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,阿根廷发生了量子异常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}quantum anomaly in Argentina.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.14,0:46:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你好  艾娃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Ava.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.37,0:46:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫比尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name's Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.57,0:46:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾是你父亲的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a friend of your father's.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.56,0:46:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你带了礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.21,0:47:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没事  再试一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. Try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.95,0:47:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.51,0:47:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,福斯特博士尽力保护我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Foster did his best to keep me safe.
