Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.23,0:47:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,把我的病症视为机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}saw an opportunity in my affliction.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.34,0:47:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们给我造了件控制衣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They built me a containment suit,
