Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.73,0:47:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我为他们偷盗  刺探{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stole for them. Spied for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.79,0:47:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,杀戮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.33,0:47:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我出卖灵魂的代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in exchange for my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.45,0:47:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是他们会治好我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they were going to cure me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.59,0:47:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他们撒了谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.12,0:47:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,神盾局陨落后  我收留了艾娃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When S.H.I.E.L.D. collapsed, I took Ava in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.25,0:47:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我建造了这个舱来减缓她的衰退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I built the chamber to slow her decay,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.49,0:47:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但她的病情在加剧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but her condition was progressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.51,0:47:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知该如何治好她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know how to cure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.12,0:47:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她想杀你的  汉克  但我阻止了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wanted to kill you, Hank, but I told her no
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.09,0:47:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,而是叫她观察你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that she should watch you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.51,0:47:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不出所料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And sure enough,
