Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.63,0:48:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's when I...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.63,0:48:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,老天爷啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.69,0:48:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的  抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's me. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.99,0:48:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,能告诉我是谁在给我发短信吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, can you tell me who's texting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.85,0:48:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,凯西  911{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Cassie, 911."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.71,0:48:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我女儿  我得给她回短信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my daughter. I need to text her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.76,0:48:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不  别想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.17,0:48:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,911就是紧急事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, it's 911. That means it's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.31,0:48:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你没资格提要求  朗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not making demands here, Lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.15,0:48:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你不懂事态多么严...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not appreciating the gravity of the...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.14,0:48:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  她在给我打视频电话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, look, she's trying to video chat me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.92,0:48:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可能真出事了  让我跟她说话  拜托了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something might be wrong. Let me talk to her. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.35,0:48:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,凯西  你没事吧  什么急事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cassie, are you okay? What's the emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.44,0:48:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我找不到我的足球鞋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't find my soccer shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.44,0:48:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.22,0:48:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天还有比赛呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a game tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.47,0:48:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特  我知道鞋就在那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Scott, I know that they're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.81,0:48:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你能拿手机在家里走一圈吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you just walk the phone around the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.17,0:48:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在不行啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I can't do that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.75,0:48:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了  - 我病了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why not? -  Because I'm sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.72,0:48:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能稍后找找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, can you just maybe look around later then
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.56,0:48:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,再打给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and call me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.47,0:48:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.66,0:48:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,再见  爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.07,0:48:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再见  小花生  - 早日康复{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye, peanut! -  Feel better!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.68,0:48:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,早日康复  哥们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel better, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.47,0:48:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起  她说急事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. It said emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.12,0:48:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,艾娃  我想帮你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ava, I want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.94,0:49:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,她不需要你的帮助  我知道怎么救她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She doesn't need your help. I know how to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.03,0:49:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗  怎么救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, really? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.65,0:49:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Janet.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.60,0:49:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,她这30年来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the last 30 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.40,0:49:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,都在量子域吸收量子能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she's been down there absorbing quantum energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.52,0:49:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以提取那能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can extract that energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.86,0:49:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,用它来修复艾娃的分子结构{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can use it to repair Ava's molecular structure...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.34,0:49:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,提取{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Extract it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.01,0:49:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的  - 你疯了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. -  Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.76,0:49:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那会把珍妮特撕裂的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would rip Janet apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.11,0:49:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这你不能确定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.54,0:49:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我要开启隧道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna fire up your tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.66,0:49:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,等珍妮特的位置出现在朗脑子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Janet's location pops into Lang's head,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.39,0:49:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他就得告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's gonna give it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.24,0:49:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我就把他交给联调局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or I'm gonna turn him over to the FBI.
