Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.96,0:49:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会帮你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like hell I would help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.47,0:49:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么说你就得怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll do whatever I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.82,0:49:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你会害死珍妮特的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna kill Janet!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.63,0:49:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是多担心自己吧  汉克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be more worried about yourself, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.93,0:49:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,该死  比尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it, Bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.67,0:49:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸  - 冷静  汉克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad? -  Calm down, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.67,0:49:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,老天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So help me God...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.07,0:49:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.03,0:49:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他的心脏  他需要吃药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's his heart! He needs his pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.75,0:49:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,求你  福斯特博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Dr. Foster.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.86,0:49:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,药就在铁盒里  拜托了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in the tin. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.94,0:49:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他会死的  拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could die! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.78,0:49:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,帮他啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.09,0:49:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸  撑住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, just hang on, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.31,0:49:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,继续呼吸  冷静点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just keep breathing. Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.66,0:49:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,帮他啊  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help him, man! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.32,0:49:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那个薄荷糖盒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Altoid tin!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.15,0:49:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.74,0:50:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢了  伙计们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.71,0:50:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,汉克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hank!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.59,0:50:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔给那姑娘灌输了一脑子的谎言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill is filling that girl's head with lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.34,0:50:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,埃利海斯·斯塔尔是个叛徒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elihas Starr was a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.84,0:50:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他偷了我的图纸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stole my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.76,0:50:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,往下点  锁定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, bring it down. All right, lock it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.11,0:50:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不不  螺栓在另一边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. The bolt is on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.01,0:50:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,把那个锁紧  往下拉一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tighten that one down, then bring it down one notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.97,0:50:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.15,0:50:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,会成功的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.30,0:50:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,福斯特  要是他做  会烧毁系统的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foster, he could have fried the entire system.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.58,0:50:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们调整继电器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, we'll adjust the relays
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.70,0:50:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你去重编程设置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while you go reprogram the settings, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.69,0:50:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,会成功的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.07,0:50:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,关键时刻到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.39,0:50:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  按说筹备了这么久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. You'd think with all this time to prepare
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.71,0:50:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我该准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be more ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.73,0:50:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你是没法为进入亚原子状态做好准备的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, going subatomic isn't something you can prepare for.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.18,0:50:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那会模糊你的意识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It kind of melts your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.92,0:51:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我是指再见到我妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean seeing my mom again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.83,0:51:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她完全变成了另一个人呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if she's a completely different person?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.28,0:51:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  比如变成了乔治·华盛顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, like, uh, George Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.57,0:51:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我说真的  斯科特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm serious, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.88,0:51:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,或是乔治·杰斐逊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or George Jefferson.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.42,0:51:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她已经忘记了我呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if she's forgotten about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.56,0:51:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我在监狱时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was in prison...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.62,0:51:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一帮我度过那段时光的就是凯西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only thing that got me through was Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.15,0:51:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪怕被关个100年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have been locked up for 100 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.76,0:51:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,也绝不会忘记她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never would have forgotten her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.19,0:51:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你妈妈肯定时刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know your mom is counting the minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.30,0:51:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,都盼着与你团聚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until she can see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.04,0:51:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.32,0:51:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有大麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.88,0:51:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你忘记大楼后面的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forgot the motion sensor lights
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.03,0:51:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,运动传感器灯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the back of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.20,0:51:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.59,0:51:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,提议案里有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they're on the proposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.16,0:51:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,卡拉佩特安还特地问到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Karapetyan asked for them specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.99,0:51:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  我们忙得挺疯的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, yeah, look, it's been a little crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.36,0:51:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧  我明天过去  看一眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, maybe I could stop by tomorrow, take a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.23,0:51:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.26,0:51:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,明天一大早就要见面了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The meeting is first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.50,0:52:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你得马上过来解决它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta come right now and fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.13,0:52:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能  我也想  但我不能走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't. I wish I could, but I can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.47,0:52:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这样  我去找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, I'm coming to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.51,0:52:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我带图纸过去  就在笔记本电脑上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just bring the plans. They're on the laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.97,0:52:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你在那里修改{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you can fix them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.63,0:52:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我你在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just tell me where you are, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.94,0:52:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一言难尽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.95,0:52:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思  一言难尽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean it's complicated?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.30,0:52:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如您所见  先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you can see, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.25,0:52:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这套系统是最先进的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this system is state of the art.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.74,0:52:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,明日的安保系统  今日享用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security of tomorrow, today.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.98,0:52:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.00,0:52:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的探身  继续练习{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I love the lean-in, bro. Keep practicin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.99,0:52:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我得开车去斯科特那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I just gotta drive up to Scotty's,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.10,0:52:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们好修改图纸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we can fix the plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.31,0:52:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心  我回来时肯定还有时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't worry, I'll be back in plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.90,0:52:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如您所见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you can see...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.07,0:52:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你们为明早把货车洗干净了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me you got the van washed for tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.63,0:52:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,底盘都洗了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down to the undercarriage, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.15,0:52:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你还要了洗底盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sprung for the undercarriage wash?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.94,0:52:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫我全洗的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you said get the works.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.20,0:52:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那是骗人的  哥们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a scam, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.84,0:52:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们住在加州  又不是明尼苏达州{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We live in California, not Minnesota.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.54,0:52:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.58,0:52:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,洗底盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The undercarriage wash,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.56,0:52:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了洗掉除冰盐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's for cleaning off road salt
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.40,0:52:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们更爱下雪的姐妹州的道路上才会撒那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}laid down in our more snow-laden sister states.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.44,0:52:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁  你怎么会这么清楚洗车行业的规矩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you, and why do you know so much about car wash protocol?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.53,0:52:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫桑尼·伯奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, my name is Sonny Burch.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.83,0:52:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我很会做调查  路易斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I do my research, Luis.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.59,0:53:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我还从一个联调局的朋友那里得知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To wit, I have learned from a friend of mine at the FBI
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.19,0:53:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟斯科特·朗相熟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you are a known associate of Scott Lang...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.76,0:53:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特和汉克·皮姆相熟  我还知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a known associate of Hank Pym, who I've also learned
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.07,0:53:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,汉克有个便携可缩小实验室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has a portable shrinking laboratory
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.37,0:53:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,里面有各式各样有趣的科技{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}filled with all kinds of juicy tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.12,0:53:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你得告诉我  它在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're gonna tell me where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.94,0:53:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不想告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I hate to break it to you, but
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.66,0:53:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不知道你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.48,0:53:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你好像有点抵触  路易斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I sense a resistance in you, Luis.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.70,0:53:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但我答应了某些危险人物给他们问出结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have promised results to some dangerous people.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.03,0:53:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  给你介绍一下我的好友  乌兹曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I'm gonna introduce you to my good friend, Uzman.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.69,0:53:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,乌兹曼特别擅长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now... Uzman is a master
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.07,0:53:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,通过精神手段{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at extracting information
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.41,0:53:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,撬开不愿开口的人的嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the unwilling through psychoactive means.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.91,0:53:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那是吐真剂吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, is that truth serum?
