Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.97,1:07:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我被骗了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like I just got fed a bowl of malarkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.50,1:07:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们抓到他们了  先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got 'em, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.36,1:07:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,皮姆和凡·戴恩都已被羁押{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pym and Van Dyne are in custody.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.98,1:07:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗  太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.28,1:07:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  斯科特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm sorry, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.80,1:07:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是你的朋友  这太不体谅了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're your friends. That's insensitive.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.50,1:07:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我太需要赢一局了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just really needed a win, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.29,1:07:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我会稍后回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, I'll be back later
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.68,1:07:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,正式结束你的刑期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the official end of your sentence!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.57,1:07:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉看错你了  哥们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry for misjudging you, pal!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.39,1:07:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你该为自己感到骄傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should feel great about yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.58,1:07:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了  - 有人受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? -  We have a man down.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.99,1:07:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,皮姆的实验室不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Pym's lab is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.26,1:08:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你掩护我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for covering for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.06,1:08:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不客气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.91,1:08:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.82,1:08:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你又开始做蚁人多久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how long have you been Ant-Man again?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.20,1:08:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,没多久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not long.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.86,1:08:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就那么发生了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just sort of happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.64,1:08:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉我隐瞒了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry for lying to you...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.29,1:08:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉我赌上了一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm sorry for risking everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.43,1:08:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸  没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.51,1:08:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不是没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.85,1:08:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了些蠢事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do some dumb things...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.21,1:08:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,而我最爱的人却为此付出代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the people that I love the most pay the price.
