Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.95,1:08:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助他人不是蠢事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trying to help people isn't dumb.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.56,1:08:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但我几乎每次都搞砸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I screw it up just about every time.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.88,1:08:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你是需要有人照应你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, maybe you just need someone watching your back,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.29,1:08:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,比如找个搭档{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like a partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.38,1:08:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,她说得很清楚  那是她最不想做的事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, she's made it clear that's about the last thing she wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.06,1:08:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.36,1:08:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,霍普{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.56,1:09:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  你想的是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, who did you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.69,1:09:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.93,1:09:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.52,1:09:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,别笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.33,1:09:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我能做个好搭档的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be a great partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.67,1:09:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小花生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, peanut.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.58,1:09:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定可棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would be awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.86,1:09:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果我允许你做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I let you...
