Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.71,1:09:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.18,1:09:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那就让霍普做你的搭档吧  她挺聪明的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then have Hope be your partner. She's smart.
