Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.03,1:09:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不知道我要怎么帮她而不伤害到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how I could help her without hurting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.18,1:09:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do it.
