Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.53,1:10:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我们的计划是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, what's our plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.54,1:10:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,缩小那面墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To shrink that wall.
