Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.52,1:10:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我估计这一层有15到20个探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I estimate 15-20 agents on the floor.
