Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.12,1:10:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.07,1:10:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,二{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.02,1:10:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scott?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.09,1:10:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你俩傻站着干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you two just standing around for?
