Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.94,1:11:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.99,1:11:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快换衣服  我们没多少时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up and get dressed. We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.48,1:11:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.
