Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.97,1:11:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰  我们打算赶紧离开吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Are we planning on leaving soon
