Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.46,1:11:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.70,1:11:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伯奇  - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Burch. -  Yeah.
