Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.20,1:12:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,她的战衣不见了  车也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her suit is missing, and so is the van.
